OL,3,CFuneral for Rugby legend Sir Billy
OL,4,CBoston to take place
OL,6,FThe funeral for rugby legend Sir Billy
OL,7,FBoston is to take place later in the
OL,8,Ftown he made his home.
OL,10,FWigan Warriors fans are invited to say
OL,11,Ffarewell to Sir Billy Boston as his
OL,12,Ffuneral takes place at the club's The
OL,13,FBrick Community Stadium on Thursday 10
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FSir Billy scored 478 tries in 487
OL,17,Fmatches for Wigan after making the
OL,18,Fswitch from rugby union to league in
OL,19,F1953.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
