OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1789159783
OL,3,CFuneral for Rugby legend Sir Billy
OL,4,CBoston to take place
OL,6,FHe scored a total of 571 tries in his
OL,7,Fcareer, making him the second-highest
OL,8,Ftry scorer in rugby league history.
OL,10,FThe legendary rugby league player
OL,11,Fpassed away on 24 August 2026, aged 92.
OL,13,FSupporters are expected to line the
OL,14,Froute of the funeral cortege as it
OL,15,Fpasses through Wigan to pay their
OL,16,Frespects.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
