OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F362A1789159783
OL,3,CFuneral for Rugby legend Sir Billy
OL,4,CBoston to take place
OL,6,FThe route begins at The Bold Hotel at
OL,7,F11.20am, before stopping at
OL,8,FHoneysuckle, Wigan Town Hall, The
OL,9,FGriffin, Uncle Joe's and then
OL,10,Fproceeding towards the stadium.
OL,12,FThe West Stand will be open as Sir
OL,13,FBilly makes his final journey down the
OL,14,FStadium Tunnel.
OL,16,FFans who attend the funeral are being
OL,17,Fasked to make a #1 donation in advance
OL,18,Fthrough the club website, with all
OL,19,Fgoing to Wigan & Leigh Hospice in
OL,20,Fmemory of Sir Billy and Lady Joan
OL,21,FBoston.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
