OL,3,CFuneral for Rugby legend Sir Billy
OL,4,CBoston to take place
OL,6,FThe stadium turnstiles will open from
OL,7,F11.15am, the funeral service starts at
OL,8,F12.30pm.
OL,10,FAt the request of the Boston Family,
OL,11,Fanyone in attendance is encouraged to
OL,12,Fwear Traditional Funeral attire, but
OL,13,Fitems of Cherry Red can be worn such
OL,14,Fas scarves, ties and headwear.
